BEHAVIOR make-addr
DESCRIPTION
  Builds a sockaddr_in for 127.0.0.1:9815.
  family AF_INET=2 (bytes 0-1), port 9815 big-endian (bytes 2-3),
  IP 127.0.0.1 (bytes 4-7). addr_len = 16.
CONTRACT
  OUTPUT addr bytes 128
  OUTPUT addr_len int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output
HASH 25b33dd7
IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE addr 2 1 0
  STORE addr 0 1 1
  STORE addr 38 1 2
  STORE addr 87 1 3
  STORE addr 127 1 4
  STORE addr 0 1 5
  STORE addr 0 1 6
  STORE addr 1 1 7
  STORE addr 0 1 8
  STORE addr 0 1 9
  STORE addr 0 1 10
  STORE addr 0 1 11
  STORE addr 0 1 12
  STORE addr 0 1 13
  STORE addr 0 1 14
  STORE addr 0 1 15
  STORE addr_len 16 8
END
